<div role="note" class="alert alert-info alert-soft my-6 block"><p class="mt-0 mb-2 font-semibold">Note</p><div class="[&>:first-child]:mt-0 [&>:last-child]:mb-0"><p>Useful information.</p>
</div></div><div role="note" class="alert alert-success alert-soft my-6 block"><p class="mt-0 mb-2 font-semibold">Tip</p><div class="[&>:first-child]:mt-0 [&>:last-child]:mb-0"><p>Lowercase works too,
over two lines.</p>
</div></div><div role="note" class="alert alert-soft my-6 block"><p class="mt-0 mb-2 font-semibold">Important</p><div class="[&>:first-child]:mt-0 [&>:last-child]:mb-0"><p>After a blank line, with <strong>bold</strong>.</p>
</div></div><div role="note" class="alert alert-warning alert-soft my-6 block"><p class="mt-0 mb-2 font-semibold">Warning</p><div class="[&>:first-child]:mt-0 [&>:last-child]:mb-0"><ul>
<li>a list inside</li>
</ul>
</div></div><div role="note" class="alert alert-error alert-soft my-6 block"><p class="mt-0 mb-2 font-semibold">Caution</p><div class="[&>:first-child]:mt-0 [&>:last-child]:mb-0"><p>Last kind.</p>
</div></div><blockquote>
<p>[!NOTE] with a title
is a plain quote.</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>Just a quote.</p>
</blockquote>
